  m_text: "Welcome to the Seal of Approval App.\nThis is a Template App to help make
    other Apps.  \n\nUse UI Panels, if you want to group UI objects together, like
    what an App looks like on the inside and for its multiple pages!\n\nUse Image
    Buttons as Icons in the Phone. \n\nUse DOTween, if you're planning to animate
    the Application.\n\nStick to using mostly UI Assets. Thank you!"
