  m_text: 'Hope your all well and safe! As per guidelines I''ve sent your the make-up
    lesson in inbox please don''t forget to review and answer your activity by the
    end of the  week.


    Next week''s lesson will be about the Types of Loops. 
    Don''t forget to bring your laptops for a grouped activity.


    See you all
    next week!'
