  m_text: "Always have caution whenever someone shares a link with a generic message.\n\nThese
    messages often invoke a sense of uregency or have a prize to make it difficult
    for you to properly asses the situation to not miss the opportunity. \n\nThis
    tricks you into giving private information to a fake app for anyone to see. "
